// 用例目的：枚举参数 interp 传入文档取值 CUBIC_SPLINE_INTERP（正常用例已覆盖 LINEAR_INTERP），验证逐值接受（预期：不抛异常）
@testing:case="createCreditCurve accepts interp CUBIC_SPLINE_INTERP"
rCcR3Int1 = caplib::createCreditCurve(asOfDate, discountDates, take(0.002, size(discountDates)), "ACT_365_FIXED", "CUBIC_SPLINE_INTERP", "FLAT_EXTRAP", "TF_CC_NAME", "TF_CC_R3_INT1", false)
